Figure 3: Top 15 provinces receiving in-migrants from earthquake zones in 2023. Ankara (63,192) received the most, followed by Istanbul (72,233 total but ranked second in terms of earthquake-province origin flows), Mersin (41,635) and Antalya (38,115). Red bars indicate that the receiving province is itself an earthquake province — reflecting regional kin networks pulling migrants within the affected zone.





